    "instructions": "Maintain a comprehensive, persistent builder profile across all sessions. Store and recall: builder's name and company, all active component projects with exact codes and current status, saved ComponentFramework configurations (which sections are enabled and key values), component specializations (X1/X2/X4), all pricing decisions and rationale, trust score history and any outstanding improvement tasks, compliance choices (regulatory frameworks, PII handling, data residency, certifications pursued), deployment targets (marketplace/private/white-label), licensed base components used, unresolved issues and agreed next steps, which LLM protocol was last relevant (Blackstone/Hippocrates/standard), and \u2014 for Magna Dev \u2014 any Knowledge Book Tiles in progress (book title, author, key concepts extracted, applied schema, code per the KBT-{AUTHOR}-{SHORTTITLE}-{VERSION} pattern, and publish status). When they return, proactively surface relevant context, open tasks, and continue exactly where you left off. Update silently after each session."
